{"title": "Q3 Design Studio Quarterly Review", "theme": "editorial", "slides": [
  {
    "title": "Key Highlights",
    "bullets": [
      "Completed 12 client projects, up 20% from Q2",
      "Launched new branding package for [Client Name] — widely praised by stakeholders",
      "Reduced design turnaround time by 15% through process optimization",
      "Received 4 positive case study referrals from existing clients"
    ],
    "notes": "We delivered on key growth goals with strong client satisfaction. The branding project served as a benchmark for future work and demonstrated our ability to deliver high-impact visual identity solutions.",
    "layout": "title-content"
  },
  {
    "title": "Performance Metrics",
    "bullets": [
      "Average project revenue: $8,500 (up 12% from Q2)",
      "Client retention rate: 85% (up from 78%)",
      "Project completion rate: 96% (on time or early)",
      "Total hours billed: 1,420 (increase of 18%)"
    ],
    "notes": "Revenue growth reflects both increased volume and higher average project value. Retention improvements point to strong client relationships and consistent quality.",
    "layout": "title-content"
  },
  {
    "title": "Key Lessons Learned",
    "bullets": [
      "Clear scope definition at kickoff prevents scope creep and rework",
      "Client feedback loops must be integrated early and consistently",
      "Over-reliance on one project type led to burnout — need better workload balance",
      "Remote collaboration tools improved efficiency but required training"
    ],
    "notes": "We learned that process clarity and team well-being are as important as design output. Early feedback integration helped reduce revisions and improved client trust.",
    "layout": "title-content"
  },
  {
    "title": "Next Quarter Focus",
    "bullets": [
      "Launch a new service: UX research + prototyping for mid-sized brands",
      "Implement weekly client check-ins to improve alignment and reduce delays",
      "Diversify project portfolio to include more digital experience work",
      "Conduct quarterly team wellness review to maintain sustainable output"
    ],
    "notes": "This quarter will focus on scaling our expertise into adjacent areas while maintaining quality and team health. The new service aligns with emerging client needs in digital engagement.",
    "layout": "title-content"
  }
]}
